<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Bit by bit, day by day, I His grace receive;</l><l>Grief and fears, pass away! How He cares for me!</l><l>In petition and prayer, tell Him everything</l><l>And the peace, peace of Christ, passes all we think.</l><l>I pursue towards the goal, run to gain the prize;</l><l>Just to know my treasured Christ, all else I’d despise.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Bit by bit, day by day, pow’r of God is shown,</l><l>What is seen’s temporal, what’s unseen we’d know;</l><l>Treasure in jars of earth, show God’s pow’r divine,</l><l>Sharing in Jesus’ death, that His life may shine;</l><l>We do not proclaim ourselves, Christ do we proclaim,</l><l>And ourselves as His bondslaves, this is all our aim.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
